{
    "title": "e.l.f. Cosmetics and Skincare",
    "description": "Sign up for Beauty Squad to unlock festive rewards and surprise drops all season!\r\n\r\nWelcome to the beauty-verse!  From viral lip oils to seriously effective skincare, shop the best of beauty for every eye, lip and face in an e.l.f.ing amazing app experience.\r\n\r\nGlow wild. This is your space to shop, share, and explore your Holy Grail e.l.f. products. Plus, you can discover your new favorite makeup and skincare products with features like Virtual Try-on, Concealer and Foundation Shade Match, and Shoppable Stories.\r\n\r\nJOIN OUR E.L.F. BEAUTY SQUAD REWARDS PROGRAM.\r\nOur FREE loyalty program gives you multiple ways to earn points: you can redeem for free products and other OMG rewards. Other perks of being in Beauty Squad:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Earn points ANYWHERE you shop when you upload your receipt on the app.\r\n\u2022 Turn your points into free products, dollars off your next purchase or gift cards from your favorite stores and restaurants like Chipotle, Target, Ulta, Amazon, Walmart and more\u2026\r\n\u2022 Shop the latest drops and sales before anyone else with early access.\r\n\u2022 Enjoy a free gift and double points during your birthday month.\r\n\u2022 Exclusive access to members-only content like our Hot as e.l.f. chart and Squad Sign quiz.*\r\n\u2022 Level up your tier for more exclusive perks like free shipping for Icon members.\r\n\r\nBE EXTRA WITHOUT PAYING EXTRA.\r\nGet instant access to e.l.f. weekly ads, gifts with purchase and special offers on makeup and skin care.\r\n\r\nE.L.F. SHOPPABLE STORIES.\r\nStay up to date with the latest drops and discover new holy grails.\r\n\r\nFIND YOUR FAVE SHADES WITH VIRTUAL TRY-ON.\r\nVirtually try on all your fave products and find your perfect shade matches.\r\n\r\nSWIPE TO LIKE.\r\nSwipe right on makeup you love with our beauty app  . Discover and explore your favourite clean beauty products with our \u201cSwipe to Like\u201d feature, and build your wishlist.\r\n\r\nGET INSTANT HELP WHILE SHOPPING IN STORE.\r\nUse the barcode scanner at your favorite retailers to virtually try on shades, view tutorials and learn all about ingredients.\r\n\r\nALWAYS STAY IN THE KNOW.\r\nOpt in for push and in-app notifications to be the first to know about e.l.f. exclusive offers, new arrivals and upcoming sales.\r\n\r\nKEEP TABS ON YOUR E.L.F. ORDER.\r\nReview your order history and track your delivery. Use the store locator to get directions to the nearest store with e.l.f. clean makeup and skincare products.\r\n\r\nSHARE THE E.L.F. LOVE.\r\nFind makeup and skincare products & look straight from the product page or virtual try-on page.\r\n\r\nelf. UP! Stay up to date on what\u2019s happening on Roblox\u2019s dynamic tycoon adventure - where you can unleash your creativity as a change maker and become a force for good in the world!\r\n\r\ne.l.f. makes the best of beauty accessible to every eye, lip and face. Download the app and we\u2019ll meet you there.",
